# Engineering sequence

Read accepted Mission Control contracts, inspect code and tests, implement the
authorized slice and validate behavior. Do not impose historical BellLabs ticket
processes or repeat permission requests already covered by user authorization.

Preserve dirty work and agree on concurrent ownership. Record gaps in the status
and removal guide. Missing live credentials or budget must remain visible as
unqualified evidence, never hidden by default skips.
